SUMMARY:TLVA Weekly Wednesday Coffees
DESCRIPTION:<p>Join the Texas Law Veterans Association for coffee and
  conversation every Wednesday morning from 8 am to 9 am in the Tom Clark
  Lounge (next to the Docket). It's a great way to connect with fellow
  veterans\, build community\, and start your day with good company and
  caffeine. All law veteran students\, alumni\, and supporters of the org
  are welcome. </p>If you need an accommodation to participate in this
  event, please contact the event sponsor or the Texas Law Special Events
  Office at specialevents@law.utexas.edu no later than seven business days
  prior to the event.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>Join the Texas Law Veterans Association
  for coffee and conversation every Wednesday morning from 8 am to 9 am in
  the Tom Clark Lounge (next to the Docket). It's a great way to connect
  with fellow veterans\, build community\, and start your day with good
  company and caffeine. All law veteran students\, alumni\, and supporters
  of the org are welcome. </p><p>If you need an accommodation to
  participate in this event, please contact the
              event sponsor or the Texas Law Special Events Office at <a
  href="mailto:specialevents@law.utexas.edu">specialevents@law.utexas.edu</
  a> no later than seven business days prior to the event.</p>
LOCATION:
URL:https://law.utexas.edu/calendar/2026/11/18/89693/
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
