SUMMARY:NRF & BOA Breakfast!
DESCRIPTION:<p>Come join BOA and our friends from Norton Rose Fulbright
  for breakfast and good chats! We'll be serving breakfast tacos\,
  breakfast sandwiches\, coffee\, and juice from Two Goose Market &
  Barbecue. Please RSVP\; registration will close on Friday\, November
  13.</p>
  <p><a
  href="https://florecruit.com/v2/app/nrf/registration/events/110237/regist
  er">https://florecruit.com/v2/app/nrf/registration/events/110237/register
  </a></p>If you need an accommodation to participate in this event, please
  contact the event sponsor or the Texas Law Special Events Office at
  specialevents@law.utexas.edu no later than seven business days prior to
  the event.
